\f3 \cf0 \strokec2  d\'e9croissante : 
\f5 \cf4 \strokec4 translateX = 4 * Math.sin((frame-8) * 2.5) * Math.exp(-(frame-8) * 0.3)
\f3 \cf0 \strokec2 \
